{"text":"The instructions are to leave the room and return with enthusiasm and do something great without having a clue what that might be. And you can't use words or props or anything. Now, I don't know about you, but that terrifies me, especially because laughter is the one thing that an audience never lies about. They only give it to you when they're really tickled. This was an exercise from a clown class at Yale. Now, not the painted clown with the painted face and the red nose and the big shoes and baggy trousers that you find at a circus. No, the clown I'm talking about is the simple, innocent fool that lives inside all of us. The child within us that we've spent most of our lives hiding under layers of intelligence, sensibilities, sophistication, and social cool. The one who gets great joy in making others happy and finds the fun in turning off and on a light bulb and is devastated by the pop of a balloon.","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.32,"end":0.62},{"text":"instructions","start":0.62,"end":1.02},{"text":"are","start":1.02,"end":1.48},{"text":"to","start":1.48,"end":1.62},{"text":"leave","start":1.62,"end":1.78},{"text":"the","start":1.78,"end":1.98},{"text":"room","start":1.98,"end":2.22},{"text":"and","start":3.02,"end":3.32},{"text":"return","start":3.32,"end":3.78},{"text":"with","start":3.78,"end":4.08},{"text":"enthusiasm","start":4.08,"end":4.74},{"text":"and","start":4.74,"end":5.46},{"text":"do","start":5.46,"end":5.64},{"text":"something","start":5.64,"end":6.06},{"text":"great","start":6.06,"end":6.44},{"text":"without","start":7.16,"end":7.46},{"text":"having","start":7.46,"end":7.8},{"text":"a","start":7.8,"end":7.98},{"text":"clue","start":7.98,"end":8.2},{"text":"what","start":8.2,"end":8.42},{"text":"that","start":8.42,"end":8.6},{"text":"might","start":8.6,"end":8.8},{"text":"be","start":8.8,"end":9.12,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":9.9,"end":10.02},{"text":"you","start":10.02,"end":10.14},{"text":"can't","start":10.14,"end":10.46},{